-- Close-range guard for velocity lead, no longer a UI knob. A fixed lead time
-- is geometrically correct at any range, but up close the angular error it
-- produces is huge and targets change direction constantly, so linear
-- extrapolation stops being valid. Inside this range the lead fades to zero.
local FALLOFF_M = 15

